# The backend service builds with the repository root as its context (see
# docker-compose.yml) because backend/Dockerfile COPYs backend/, scripts/, db/
# and openapi.yaml. Everything else in the root is dead weight that Docker would
# otherwise tar up and send to the daemon on every build — most of it the
# frontend's node_modules and .next. None of the exclusions below are needed by
# any Dockerfile in this repository.

# VCS and CI
.git
.github

# Python caches and virtualenvs
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Node (the frontend image installs its own; see frontend/.dockerignore)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/

# Generated artefacts and local noise
docs/eval/report.json
docs/eval/report.html
*.log
.DS_Store
